    <string name="rediscoverConfirmation">Sake neman asusu zai mayar da walat ɗin sifili sannan ya bincika blockchain don biyan kuɗin da aka yi, kamar dai sabon asusu ake ƙirƙira. Wannan aiki na iya ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo. Duk da haka, maɓallin “tsallake gaba” na iya bayyana wanda ke ba ku zaɓin tambayar wani database game da harkokin walat ɗinku. Idan kwanan watan da ke sama ba daidai ba ne, ku jira ɗan daƙiƙa kaɗan don a sabunta shi.</string>
    <string name="searchConfirmation">Wannan aikin yana bincika blockchain don biyan kuɗin da suka ɓace. Wannan aiki na iya ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo. Duk da haka, maɓallin “tsallake gaba” na iya bayyana wanda ke ba ku zaɓin tambayar wani database game da harkokin walat ɗinku.</string>
    <string name="rediscoverBlockchainConfirmation">Sake neman blockchain zai share duk bayanan headers na blockchain daga wannan walat sannan ya sake sauke su daga cikakkun nodes. Wannan aiki na iya ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo. Ku yi amfani da shi kawai idan kun tabbata akwai matsalar headers na blockchain.</string>
    <string name="deleteConfirmation" formatted="false">Share asusu zai sa duk sauran kuɗi, shaidu, da tarihi su zama ba a samun su sai an dawo da asusun ta hanyar kalmomin sirri na dawo da asusu! Ku yi haka kawai idan kun TABBATA SOSAI!\n\nA share asusu “%accountName” (a %blockchain)?</string>
    <string name="reassessConfirmation">Wannan aikin zai duba blockchain don maʼamalolin da kuka aika kwanan nan. Bisa ga samuwarsu ko rashinsu, zai tabbatar da su ko ya share su. Idan an share maʼamaloli, kuɗin za su yi kama da sun ɓace. Za ku buƙaci ku yi “sake nema” don dawo da sauran kuɗin da aka kashe. Kada ku yi amfani da shi idan kun yi maʼamala kwanan nan, domin maʼamalar na iya kasancewa a cikin sadarwa tana jiran tabbatarwa.</string>
    <string name="recoveryPhrase">Ana amfani da waɗannan kalmomi 12 don dawo da walat ɗinku. Duk wanda ya mallaki waɗannan kalmomi zai iya kashe kuɗinku. Ku rubuta su da alƙalami a takarda (ko ku sassaƙa su a ƙarfe) sannan ku ajiye su a wuri mai tsaro!</string>
    <string name="recoveryWarning">TSAYA! KADA KU AJIYE SU A DIJITAL!\nKADA ku kwafa zuwa allon kwafi, ku ɗauki hoto, ku kwafa a inji, ko ku ɗauki hoton allo.</string>
    <string name="flickerReason">Kyaftawa matakin tsaro ne</string>
    <string name="PastingRecoveryPhraseIsBadIdea">An kwafa zuwa allon kwafi. Amma dai, kwafawa da mannawa waɗannan kalmomin sirri a kowace manhaja BABBAN KUSKURE ne! Imel, yawancin manhajoji, sabis na kwafin ajiya, da sauransu ba su da tsaro na gaskiya yadda ya kamata don riƙe kalmomin da a zahiri kuɗi ne.</string>
    <string name="primaryAccountConfirmation">Babban asusunku shi ne asusun da ake amfani da shi don shaidarku da kuma biyan atomatik. Shi ne kuma asusu na farko da ake nunawa a wurare daban-daban a wannan manhaja. Dole ne ya kasance a blockchain ɗin Nexa.</string>
